ith me on the table.", "tokens": [50948, 583, 27234, 11, 264, 1011, 295, 796, 567, 15560, 82, 385, 307, 365, 385, 322, 264, 3199, 13, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16013471703780324, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004140608652960509}, {"id": 33, "seek": 11998, "start": 137.44, "end": 139.9, "text": " For the Son of Man goes as it has been determined,", "tokens": [51238, 1171, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 1709, 382, 309, 575, 668, 9540, 11, 51361], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16013471703780324, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004140608652960509}, {"id": 34, "seek": 11998, "start": 140.56, "end": 143.3, "text": " but woe to that man by whom he is betrayed.", "tokens": [51394, 457, 6020, 68, 281, 300, 587, 538, 7101, 415, 307, 29515, 13, 51531], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16013471703780324, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004140608652960509}, {"id": 35, "seek": 11998, "start": 144.24, "end": 146.02, "text": " And they began to question one another,", "tokens": [51578, 400, 436, 4283, 281, 1168, 472, 1071, 11, 51667], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16013471703780324, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004140608652960509}, {"id": 36, "seek": 11998, "start": 146.56, "end": 149.32, "text": " which of them it could be who was going to do this.", "tokens": [51694, 597, 295, 552, 309, 727, 312, 567, 390, 516, 281, 360, 341, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16013471703780324, "compression_ratio": 1.6095617529880477, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004140608652960509}, {"id": 37, "seek": 14998, "start": 149.98, "end": 154.88, "text": " A dispute also arose among them as to which of them was to be regarded as the greatest.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 25379, 611, 37192, 3654, 552, 382, 281, 597, 295, 552, 390, 281, 312, 26047, 382, 264, 6636, 13, 50610], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 38, "seek": 14998, "start": 155.67999999999998, "end": 156.67999999999998, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [50650, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50700], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 39, "seek": 14998, "start": 156.84, "end": 160.57999999999998, "text": " The kings of the Gentiles exercise lordship over them,", "tokens": [50708, 440, 21581, 295, 264, 33070, 4680, 5380, 15448, 5278, 670, 552, 11, 50895], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14998, "start": 160.92, "end": 163.88, "text": " and those in authority over them are called benefactors.", "tokens": [50912, 293, 729, 294, 8281, 670, 552, 366, 1219, 3070, 578, 830, 13, 51060], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14998, "start": 164.5, "end": 165.98, "text": " But not so with you.", "tokens": [51091, 583, 406, 370, 365, 291, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14998, "start": 166.5, "end": 169.51999999999998, "text": " Rather, let the greatest among you become as the youngest,", "tokens": [51191, 16571, 11, 718, 264, 6636, 3654, 291, 1813, 382, 264, 17747, 11, 51342], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14998, "start": 169.98, "end": 171.95999999999998, "text": " and the leader as one who serves.", "tokens": [51365, 293, 264, 5263, 382, 472, 567, 13451, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14998, "start": 172.51999999999998, "end": 177.39999999999998, "text": " For who is the greater, one who reclines at table or one who serves?", "tokens": [51492, 1171, 567, 307, 264, 5044, 11, 472, 567, 850, 11045, 412, 3199, 420, 472, 567, 13451, 30, 51736], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14998, "start": 178.01999999999998, "end": 179.95999999999998, "text": " Is it not the one who reclines at table?", "tokens": [51767, 1119, 309, 406, 264, 472, 567, 850, 11045, 412, 3199, 30, 51864], "temperature": 0.6000000000000001, "avg_logprob": -0.23409196807116997, "compression_ratio": 1.8271604938271604, "no_speech_prob": 8.818863716442138e-05}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17996, "start": 179.96, "end": 186.72, "text": " a table? But I am among you, as the one who serves. You are those who have stayed with me", "tokens": [50365, 257, 3199, 30, 583, 286, 669, 3654, 291, 11, 382, 264, 472, 567, 13451, 13, 509, 366, 729, 567, 362, 9181, 365, 385, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07915111616546032, "compression_ratio": 1.6444444444444444, "no_speech_prob": 0.1441137045621872}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17996, "start": 186.72, "end": 193.66, "text": " in my trials, and I assign to you, as my Father assigned to me, a kingdom, that you may eat and", "tokens": [50703, 294, 452, 12450, 11, 293, 286, 6269, 281, 291, 11, 382, 452, 7085, 13279, 281, 385, 11, 257, 10231, 11, 300, 291, 815, 1862, 293, 51050], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07915111616546032, "compression_ratio": 1.6444444444444444, "no_speech_prob": 0.1441137045621872}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17996, "start": 193.66, "end": 198.92000000000002, "text": " drink at my table in my kingdom, and sit on thrones judging the twelve tribes of Israel.", "tokens": [51050, 2822, 412, 452, 3199, 294, 452, 10231, 11, 293, 1394, 322, 739, 2213, 23587, 264, 14390, 19035, 295, 5674, 13, 51313], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07915111616546032, "compression_ratio": 1.6444444444444444, "no_speech_prob": 0.1441137045621872}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17996, "start": 200.16, "end": 208.20000000000002, "text": " Simon, Simon, behold, Satan demanded to have you, that he might sift you like wheat. But I have", "tokens": [51375, 13193, 11, 13193, 11, 27234, 11, 16583, 28276, 281, 362, 291, 11, 300, 415, 1062, 262, 2008, 291, 411, 16691, 13, 583, 286, 362, 51777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07915111616546032, "compression_ratio": 1.6444444444444444, "no_speech_prob": 0.1441137045621872}, {"id": 50, "seek": 20820, "start": 208.2, "end": 214.16, "text": " prayed for you, that your faith may not fail, and when you have turned again, strengthen your", "tokens": [50365, 22532, 337, 291, 11, 300, 428, 4522, 815, 406, 3061, 11, 293, 562, 291, 362, 3574, 797, 11, 17045, 428, 50663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05783861492751935, "compression_ratio": 1.6322314049586777, "no_speech_prob": 1.8200107660959475e-05}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20820, "start": 214.16, "end": 222.92, "text": " brothers. Peter said to him, Lord, I am ready to go with you both to prison and to death. Jesus", "tokens": [50663, 8452, 13, 6508, 848, 281, 796, 11, 3257, 11, 286, 669, 1919, 281, 352, 365, 291, 1293, 281, 6168, 293, 281, 2966, 13, 2705, 51101], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05783861492751935, "compression_ratio": 1.6322314049586777, "no_speech_prob": 1.8200107660959475e-05}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20820, "start": 222.92, "end": 230.29999999999998, "text": " said, I tell you, Peter, the rooster will not crow this day until you deny three times that you know", "tokens": [51101, 848, 11, 286, 980, 291, 11, 6508, 11, 264, 744, 7096, 486, 406, 6401, 341, 786, 1826, 291, 15744, 1045, 1413, 300, 291, 458, 51470], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05783861492751935, "compression_ratio": 1.6322314049586777, "no_speech_prob": 1.8200107660959475e-05}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20820, "start": 230.29999999999998, "end": 237.92, "text": " me. And he said to them, When I sent you out with no money bag or knapsack or sandals, did you lack", "tokens": [51470, 385, 13, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 1133, 286, 2279, 291, 484, 365, 572, 1460, 3411, 420, 444, 2382, 501, 420, 4932, 1124, 11, 630, 291, 5011, 51851], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05783861492751935, "compression_ratio": 1.6322314049586777, "no_speech_prob": 1.8200107660959475e-05}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20820, "start": 237.92, "end": 238.17999999999998, "text": " any?", "tokens": [51851, 604, 30, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05783861492751935, "compression_ratio": 1.6322314049586777, "no_speech_prob": 1.8200107660959475e-05}, {"id": 55, "seek": 23820, "start": 238.2, "end": 246.85999999999999, "text": " They said, Nothing. He said to them, But now let the one who has a money bag take it,", "tokens": [50365, 814, 848, 11, 6693, 13, 634, 848, 281, 552, 11, 583, 586, 718, 264, 472, 567, 575, 257, 1460, 3411, 747, 309, 11, 50798], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08275089449095495, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 0.00027586097712628543}, {"id": 56, "seek": 23820, "start": 247.2, "end": 252.23999999999998, "text": " and likewise a knapsack, and let the one who has no sword sell his cloak and buy one.", "tokens": [50815, 293, 32407, 257, 444, 2382, 501, 11, 293, 718, 264, 472, 567, 575, 572, 10576, 3607, 702, 45004, 293, 2256, 472, 13, 51067], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08275089449095495, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 0.00027586097712628543}, {"id": 57, "seek": 23820, "start": 252.89999999999998, "end": 259.02, "text": " For I tell you, that this scripture must be fulfilled in me. And he was numbered with the", "tokens": [51100, 1171, 286, 980, 291, 11, 300, 341, 24783, 1633, 312, 21380, 294, 385, 13, 400, 415, 390, 40936, 365, 264, 51406], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08275089449095495, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 0.00027586097712628543}, {"id": 58, "seek": 23820, "start": 259.02, "end": 266.8, "text": " transgressors. For what is written about me has its fulfillment. And they said, Look, Lord,", "tokens": [51406, 1145, 3091, 830, 13, 1171, 437, 307, 3720, 466, 385, 575, 1080, 32615, 13, 400, 436, 848, 11, 2053, 11, 3257, 11, 51795], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08275089449095495, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 0.00027586097712628543}, {"id": 59, "seek": 23820, "start": 266.8, "end": 268.18, "text": " here are two swords.", "tokens": [51795, 510, 366, 732, 26474, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08275089449095495, "compression_ratio": 1.619047619047619, "no_speech_prob": 0.00027586097712628543}, {"id": 60, "seek": 26820, "start": 268.2, "end": 271.68, "text": " And he said to them, It is enough.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 467, 307, 1547, 13, 50539], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965772702143744, "compression_ratio": 1.6478260869565218, "no_speech_prob": 0.004297514446079731}, {"id": 61, "seek": 26820, "start": 273.44, "end": 278.62, "text": " And he came out and went, as was his custom, to the Mount of Olives. And the disciples followed", "tokens": [50627, 400, 415, 1361, 484, 293, 1437, 11, 382, 390, 702, 2375, 11, 281, 264, 8426, 295, 6141, 1539, 13, 400, 264, 17209, 6263, 50886], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965772702143744, "compression_ratio": 1.6478260869565218, "no_speech_prob": 0.004297514446079731}, {"id": 62, "seek": 26820, "start": 278.62, "end": 285.44, "text": " him. And when he came to the place, he said to them, Pray that you may not enter into temptation.", "tokens": [50886, 796, 13, 400, 562, 415, 1361, 281, 264, 1081, 11, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 36365, 300, 291, 815, 406, 3242, 666, 30423, 13, 51227], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965772702143744, "compression_ratio": 1.6478260869565218, "no_speech_prob": 0.004297514446079731}, {"id": 63, "seek": 26820, "start": 286.32, "end": 291.14, "text": " And he withdrew from them about a stone's throw, and knelt down and prayed, saying,", "tokens": [51271, 400, 415, 12483, 2236, 490, 552, 466, 257, 7581, 311, 3507, 11, 293, 444, 2018, 760, 293, 22532, 11, 1566, 11, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965772702143744, "compression_ratio": 1.6478260869565218, "no_speech_prob": 0.004297514446079731}, {"id": 64, "seek": 26820, "start": 291.86, "end": 297.71999999999997, "text": " Father, if you are willing, remove this cup from me. Nevertheless,", "tokens": [51548, 7085, 11, 498, 291, 366, 4950, 11, 4159, 341, 4414, 490, 385, 13, 26554, 11, 51841], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12965772702143744, "compression_ratio": 1.6478260869565218, "no_speech_prob": 0.004297514446079731}, {"id": 65, "seek": 29820, "start": 298.2, "end": 304.56, "text": " not my will, but yours be done. And there appeared to him an angel from heaven,", "tokens": [50365, 406, 452, 486, 11, 457, 6342, 312, 1096, 13, 400, 456, 8516, 281, 796, 364, 14250, 490, 7162, 11, 50683], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11872542138193168, "compression_ratio": 1.6639676113360324, "no_speech_prob": 0.006002627778798342}, {"id": 66, "seek": 29820, "start": 304.8, "end": 310.53999999999996, "text": " strengthening him. And being in an agony, he prayed more earnestly, and his sweat became", "tokens": [50695, 28224, 796, 13, 400, 885, 294, 364, 46025, 11, 415, 22532, 544, 6012, 11154, 11, 293, 702, 11872, 3062, 50982], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11872542138193168, "compression_ratio": 1.6639676113360324, "no_speech_prob": 0.006002627778798342}, {"id": 67, "seek": 29820, "start": 310.53999999999996, "end": 315.68, "text": " like great drops of blood falling down to the ground. And when he rose from prayer,", "tokens": [50982, 411, 869, 11438, 295, 3390, 7440, 760, 281, 264, 2727, 13, 400, 562, 415, 10895, 490, 8767, 11, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11872542138193168, "compression_ratio": 1.6639676113360324, "no_speech_prob": 0.006002627778798342}, {"id": 68, "seek": 29820, "start": 316.12, "end": 320.9, "text": " he came to the disciples and found them sleeping for sorrow. And he said to them,", "tokens": [51261, 415, 1361, 281, 264, 17209, 293, 1352, 552, 8296, 337, 23027, 13, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51500], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11872542138193168, "compression_ratio": 1.6639676113360324, "no_speech_prob": 0.006002627778798342}, {"id": 69, "seek": 29820, "start": 321.44, "end": 327.4, "text": " Why are you sleeping? Rise and pray, that you may not enter into temptation.", "tokens": [51527, 1545, 366, 291, 8296, 30, 34482, 293, 3690, 11, 300, 291, 815, 406, 3242, 666, 30423, 13, 51825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11872542138193168, "compression_ratio": 1.6639676113360324, "no_speech_prob": 0.006002627778798342}, {"id": 70, "seek": 32820, "start": 328.2, "end": 332.4, "text": " While he was still speaking, there came a crowd, and the man called Judas,", "tokens": [50365, 3987, 415, 390, 920, 4124, 11, 456, 1361, 257, 6919, 11, 293, 264, 587, 1219, 49632, 11, 50575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 71, "seek": 32820, "start": 332.4, "end": 338.5, "text": " one of the twelve, was leading them. He drew near to Jesus to kiss him. But Jesus said to him,", "tokens": [50575, 472, 295, 264, 14390, 11, 390, 5775, 552, 13, 634, 12804, 2651, 281, 2705, 281, 7704, 796, 13, 583, 2705, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50880], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 72, "seek": 32820, "start": 339.28, "end": 343.71999999999997, "text": " Judas, would you betray the Son of Man with a kiss?", "tokens": [50919, 49632, 11, 576, 291, 15560, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 365, 257, 7704, 30, 51141], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 73, "seek": 32820, "start": 344.2, "end": 347.68, "text": " And when those who were around him saw what would follow, they said,", "tokens": [51165, 400, 562, 729, 567, 645, 926, 796, 1866, 437, 576, 1524, 11, 436, 848, 11, 51339], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 74, "seek": 32820, "start": 348.38, "end": 353.71999999999997, "text": " Lord, shall we strike with the sword? And one of them struck the servant of the high priest and", "tokens": [51374, 3257, 11, 4393, 321, 9302, 365, 264, 10576, 30, 400, 472, 295, 552, 13159, 264, 17896, 295, 264, 1090, 15703, 293, 51641], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 75, "seek": 32820, "start": 353.71999999999997, "end": 356.74, "text": " cut off his right ear. But Jesus said,", "tokens": [51641, 1723, 766, 702, 558, 1273, 13, 583, 2705, 848, 11, 51792], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 76, "seek": 32820, "start": 357.24, "end": 358.18, "text": " No more of you.", "tokens": [51817, 883, 544, 295, 291, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1516983568175765, "compression_ratio": 1.683206106870229, "no_speech_prob": 0.009774746373295784}, {"id": 77, "seek": 35818, "start": 358.18, "end": 364.78000000000003, "text": " And he touched his ear and healed him. Then Jesus said to the chief priests and officers", "tokens": [50365, 400, 415, 9828, 702, 1273, 293, 20482, 796, 13, 1396, 2705, 848, 281, 264, 9588, 27192, 293, 9199, 50695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15881080348996351, "compression_ratio": 1.8116438356164384, "no_speech_prob": 0.002550749108195305}, {"id": 78, "seek": 35818, "start": 364.78000000000003, "end": 370.04, "text": " of the temple and elders who had come out against him, Have you come out as against a robber,", "tokens": [50695, 295, 264, 10184, 293, 22737, 567, 632, 808, 484, 1970, 796, 11, 3560, 291, 808, 484, 382, 1970, 257, 3870, 607, 11, 50958], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15881080348996351, "compression_ratio": 1.8116438356164384, "no_speech_prob": 0.002550749108195305}, {"id": 79, "seek": 35818, "start": 370.22, "end": 375.94, "text": " with swords and clubs? When I was with you day after day in the temple, you did not lay hands", "tokens": [50967, 365, 26474, 293, 15428, 30, 1133, 286, 390, 365, 291, 786, 934, 786, 294, 264, 10184, 11, 291, 630, 406, 2360, 2377, 51253], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15881080348996351, "compression_ratio": 1.8116438356164384, "no_speech_prob": 0.002550749108195305}, {"id": 80, "seek": 35818, "start": 375.94, "end": 382.64, "text": " on me, but this is your hour and the power of darkness. Then they seized him and led him away,", "tokens": [51253, 322, 385, 11, 457, 341, 307, 428, 1773, 293, 264, 1347, 295, 11262, 13, 1396, 436, 33912, 796, 293, 4684, 796, 1314, 11, 51588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15881080348996351, "compression_ratio": 1.8116438356164384, "no_speech_prob": 0.002550749108195305}, {"id": 81, "seek": 35818, "start": 382.64, "end": 387.18, "text": " bringing him into the high priest's house. And Peter was following at a distance.", "tokens": [51588, 5062, 796, 666, 264, 1090, 15703, 311, 1782, 13, 400, 6508, 390, 3480, 412, 257, 4560, 13, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15881080348996351, "compression_ratio": 1.8116438356164384, "no_speech_prob": 0.002550749108195305}, {"id": 82, "seek": 35818, "start": 387.74, "end": 388.16, "text": " And when they saw him, they said to him, What is this? And he said to them,", "tokens": [51843, 400, 562, 436, 1866, 796, 11, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 708, 307, 341, 30, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15881080348996351, "compression_ratio": 1.8116438356164384, "no_speech_prob": 0.002550749108195305}, {"id": 83, "seek": 38816, "start": 388.16, "end": 391.62, "text": " When they had kindled a fire in the middle of the courtyard and sat down together,", "tokens": [50365, 1133, 436, 632, 733, 1493, 257, 2610, 294, 264, 2808, 295, 264, 41364, 293, 3227, 760, 1214, 11, 50538], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 84, "seek": 38816, "start": 392.28000000000003, "end": 397.06, "text": " Peter sat down among them. Then a servant girl, seeing him as he sat in the light,", "tokens": [50571, 6508, 3227, 760, 3654, 552, 13, 1396, 257, 17896, 2013, 11, 2577, 796, 382, 415, 3227, 294, 264, 1442, 11, 50810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 85, "seek": 38816, "start": 397.36, "end": 401.76000000000005, "text": " and looking closely at him, said, This man also was with him.", "tokens": [50825, 293, 1237, 8185, 412, 796, 11, 848, 11, 639, 587, 611, 390, 365, 796, 13, 51045], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 86, "seek": 38816, "start": 402.38000000000005, "end": 407.02000000000004, "text": " But he denied it, saying, Woman, I do not know him.", "tokens": [51076, 583, 415, 17774, 309, 11, 1566, 11, 15794, 11, 286, 360, 406, 458, 796, 13, 51308], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 87, "seek": 38816, "start": 407.70000000000005, "end": 412.38, "text": " And a little later someone else saw him and said, You also are one of them.", "tokens": [51342, 400, 257, 707, 1780, 1580, 1646, 1866, 796, 293, 848, 11, 509, 611, 366, 472, 295, 552, 13, 51576], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 88, "seek": 38816, "start": 412.8, "end": 416.28000000000003, "text": " But Peter said, Man, I am not.", "tokens": [51597, 583, 6508, 848, 11, 2458, 11, 286, 669, 406, 13, 51771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 89, "seek": 38816, "start": 416.84000000000003, "end": 418.14000000000004, "text": " And after an interval of a while, Peter said, I am not.", "tokens": [51799, 400, 934, 364, 15035, 295, 257, 1339, 11, 6508, 848, 11, 286, 669, 406, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16402885857529528, "compression_ratio": 1.7470355731225296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005527357570827007}, {"id": 90, "seek": 41814, "start": 418.14, "end": 420.7, "text": " And after an interval of about an hour, still another insisted, saying,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 934, 364, 15035, 295, 466, 364, 1773, 11, 920, 1071, 28456, 11, 1566, 11, 50493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 91, "seek": 41814, "start": 421.36, "end": 425.28, "text": " Certainly this man also was with him, for he too is a Galilean.", "tokens": [50526, 16628, 341, 587, 611, 390, 365, 796, 11, 337, 415, 886, 307, 257, 46576, 282, 13, 50722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 92, "seek": 41814, "start": 425.9, "end": 431.86, "text": " But Peter said, Man, I do not know what you are talking about.", "tokens": [50753, 583, 6508, 848, 11, 2458, 11, 286, 360, 406, 458, 437, 291, 366, 1417, 466, 13, 51051], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 93, "seek": 41814, "start": 432.46, "end": 436.4, "text": " And immediately, while he was still speaking, the rooster crowed.", "tokens": [51081, 400, 4258, 11, 1339, 415, 390, 920, 4124, 11, 264, 744, 7096, 6401, 292, 13, 51278], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 94, "seek": 41814, "start": 437.28, "end": 441.71999999999997, "text": " And the Lord turned and looked at Peter. And Peter remembered the saying of the Lord,", "tokens": [51322, 400, 264, 3257, 3574, 293, 2956, 412, 6508, 13, 400, 6508, 13745, 264, 1566, 295, 264, 3257, 11, 51544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 95, "seek": 41814, "start": 442.06, "end": 445.9, "text": " how he had said to him, Before the rooster crows today,", "tokens": [51561, 577, 415, 632, 848, 281, 796, 11, 4546, 264, 744, 7096, 941, 1509, 965, 11, 51753], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 96, "seek": 41814, "start": 445.9, "end": 447.9, "text": " you will deny me three times.", "tokens": [51753, 291, 486, 15744, 385, 1045, 1413, 13, 51853], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14416507166675013, "compression_ratio": 1.676923076923077, "no_speech_prob": 0.00011501619155751541}, {"id": 97, "seek": 44814, "start": 448.14, "end": 451.38, "text": " And he went out and wept bitterly.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 415, 1437, 484, 293, 321, 662, 13871, 356, 13, 50527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 98, "seek": 44814, "start": 452.78, "end": 457.3, "text": " Now the men who were holding Jesus in custody were mocking him as they beat him.", "tokens": [50597, 823, 264, 1706, 567, 645, 5061, 2705, 294, 26976, 645, 49792, 796, 382, 436, 4224, 796, 13, 50823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 99, "seek": 44814, "start": 457.94, "end": 460.53999999999996, "text": " They also blindfolded him and kept asking him,", "tokens": [50855, 814, 611, 44846, 292, 796, 293, 4305, 3365, 796, 11, 50985], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 100, "seek": 44814, "start": 461.03999999999996, "end": 464.7, "text": " Prophesy! Who is it that struck you?", "tokens": [51010, 1705, 950, 17823, 0, 2102, 307, 309, 300, 13159, 291, 30, 51193], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 101, "seek": 44814, "start": 465.7, "end": 468.53999999999996, "text": " And they said many other things against him, blaspheming him.", "tokens": [51243, 400, 436, 848, 867, 661, 721, 1970, 796, 11, 46409, 41245, 278, 796, 13, 51385], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 102, "seek": 44814, "start": 469.58, "end": 473.28, "text": " When day came, the assembly of the elders of the people gathered together,", "tokens": [51437, 1133, 786, 1361, 11, 264, 12103, 295, 264, 22737, 295, 264, 561, 13032, 1214, 11, 51622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 103, "seek": 44814, "start": 473.28, "end": 477.5, "text": " both chief priests and scribes, and they led him away to their council.", "tokens": [51622, 1293, 9588, 27192, 293, 39435, 279, 11, 293, 436, 4684, 796, 1314, 281, 641, 9209, 13, 51833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1795396892302627, "compression_ratio": 1.632, "no_speech_prob": 0.013633699156343937}, {"id": 104, "seek": 47750, "start": 477.5, "end": 481.74, "text": " And they said, If you are the Christ, tell us.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 436, 848, 11, 759, 291, 366, 264, 2040, 11, 980, 505, 13, 50577], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 105, "seek": 47750, "start": 482.38, "end": 486.84, "text": " But he said to them, If I tell you, you will not believe.", "tokens": [50609, 583, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 759, 286, 980, 291, 11, 291, 486, 406, 1697, 13, 50832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 106, "seek": 47750, "start": 487.34, "end": 489.48, "text": " And if I ask you, you will not answer.", "tokens": [50857, 400, 498, 286, 1029, 291, 11, 291, 486, 406, 1867, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 107, "seek": 47750, "start": 490.2, "end": 495.98, "text": " But from now on the Son of Man shall be seated at the right hand of the power of God.", "tokens": [51000, 583, 490, 586, 322, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 4393, 312, 20959, 412, 264, 558, 1011, 295, 264, 1347, 295, 1265, 13, 51289], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 108, "seek": 47750, "start": 496.46, "end": 501.52, "text": " So they all said, Are you the Son of God then?", "tokens": [51313, 407, 436, 439, 848, 11, 2014, 291, 264, 5185, 295, 1265, 550, 30, 51566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 109, "seek": 47750, "start": 501.9, "end": 505.92, "text": " And he said to them, You say that I am.", "tokens": [51585, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 509, 584, 300, 286, 669, 13, 51786], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 110, "seek": 47750, "start": 506.38, "end": 507.48, "text": " Then they said,", "tokens": [51809, 1396, 436, 848, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16182725088936942, "compression_ratio": 1.7202072538860103, "no_speech_prob": 0.002394413808360696}, {"id": 111, "seek": 50750, "start": 508.26, "end": 511.14, "text": " What further testimony do we need?", "tokens": [50403, 708, 3052, 15634, 360, 321, 643, 30, 50547], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.53527281834529, "compression_ratio": 1.0602409638554218, "no_speech_prob": 0.002628589980304241}, {"id": 112, "seek": 50750, "start": 511.46, "end": 515.62, "text": " We have heard it ourselves from his own lips.", "tokens": [50563, 492, 362, 2198, 309, 4175, 490, 702, 1065, 10118, 13, 50771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.53527281834529, "compression_ratio": 1.0602409638554218, "no_speech_prob": 0.002628589980304241}, {"id": 113, "seek": 50750, "start": 519.74, "end": 524.74, "text": " The End", "tokens": [50977, 440, 6967, 51227], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.53527281834529, "compression_ratio": 1.0602409638554218, "no_speech_prob": 0.002628589980304241}], "language": "English"}